## 2. Move every `use-auth-store` reader onto `useCurrentUser()`

`src/stores/use-auth-store.ts` was left in place on purpose - nothing was
deleted. Session state now lives in the `{{ queryKeyScope }}.currentUser`
query, which is the only thing the API can confirm. Each file below still
reads the store:

{{ authStoreImporters }}

Once that list is empty the store file is yours to delete.

